  "evidences": [
    {
      "id": "ev_1",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "TrendMicro_Update-PawnStorm-Politically-Motivated-Campaigns(01-12-2018)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p1_s1"
      },
      "text": "blog.trendmicro.com /trendlabs-security-intelligence/update-pawn-storm-new-targets-politically-motivated-campaigns/ In the second half of 2017 Pawn Storm, an extremely active espionage actor group, didn’t shy away from continuing their brazen attacks.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_3",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "TrendMicro_Update-PawnStorm-Politically-Motivated-Campaigns(01-12-2018)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p1_s3"
      },
      "text": "Pawn Storm has a large toolset full of social engineering tricks, malware and exploits, and therefore doesn’t need much innovation apart from occasionally using their own zero-days and quickly abusing software vulnerabilities shortly after a security patch is released.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_6",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "TrendMicro_Update-PawnStorm-Politically-Motivated-Campaigns(01-12-2018)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p1_s6"
      },
      "text": "We can often closely relate current and old Pawn Storm campaigns using data that spans more than four years, possibly because the actors in the group follow a script when setting up an attack.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_13",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "TrendMicro_Update-PawnStorm-Politically-Motivated-Campaigns(01-12-2018)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 3,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p3_s5"
      },
      "text": "Political targets In the week of the 2017 presidential elections in Iran, Pawn Storm set up a phishing site targeting chmail.ir webmail users.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_15",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "TrendMicro_Update-PawnStorm-Politically-Motivated-Campaigns(01-12-2018)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 3,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p3_s7"
      },
      "text": "Beginning in June 2017, phishing sites were set up mimicking the ADFS (Active Directory Federation Services) of the U.S.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_17",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "TrendMicro_Update-PawnStorm-Politically-Motivated-Campaigns(01-12-2018)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 3,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p3_s9"
      },
      "text": "Senate is not reachable on the open internet, however phishing of users’ credentials on an ADFS server that is behind a firewall still makes sense.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_26",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "TrendMicro_Update-PawnStorm-Politically-Motivated-Campaigns(01-12-2018)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 4,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p4_s6"
      },
      "text": "In 2016, we published a report on C Major, an espionage group that primarily targets the Indian military.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_27",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "TrendMicro_Update-PawnStorm-Politically-Motivated-Campaigns(01-12-2018)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 4,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p4_s7"
      },
      "text": "By digging deeper into C Major’s activities, we found that this actor group not only attacks the Indian military, but also has dedicated botnets for compromised targets in Iranian universities, Afghanistan, and Pakistan.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_28",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "TrendMicro_Update-PawnStorm-Politically-Motivated-Campaigns(01-12-2018)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 4,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p4_s8"
      },
      "text": "Recently, we have witnessed C Major also showing some interest in compromising military and diplomatic targets in the West.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_29",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "TrendMicro_Update-PawnStorm-Politically-Motivated-Campaigns(01-12-2018)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 4,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p4_s9"
      },
      "text": "It is only a matter of time before actors like C Major begin attempting to influence public opinion in foreign countries, as well.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_31",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
